From 1f58045a06d272c9a824b7b46a2589fe93d577e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Be <m.gonser@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:09:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat: add project & file explorer panel
 (Excalidraw-Plus-style)

Left-docked Files panel with project/file tree backed by /api/explorer:
create/rename/delete/move, click-to-open with pre-switch flush, debounced
autosave (1.5s) with keepalive flush on unload, disabled during collab.
Active file persisted in localStorage and restored on startup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
