From 880c7a4f4d64a6aa2c37b0ccad4bacb17aa849b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Be <m.gonser@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 13:07:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] fix: explorer E2E findings (autosave loop, stale canvas,
 dark mode, tree state, z-order)

- content-based dirty detection via scene fingerprint instead of marking
  every onChange dirty; save no longer re-triggers itself via state updates
- clearing the active file now resets the canvas and pauses the
  localStorage fallback while an explorer file is open
- panel/context menu use sidebar/popup background tokens (dark mode)
- active file's project auto-expands after reload
- panel z-index 3: above the interactive canvas, below the layer UI so the
  main menu dropdown stays usable while the panel is open

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
