From 7811a7222381bcc1edd4becc92372f939b39dce4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Be <m.gonser@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 13:55:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] feat: explorer drag & drop and custom dialogs

- name/delete dialogs built on the package's Dialog/ConfirmDialog/TextField
  (validation, Enter/Escape, autofocus, cascade warning); no native
  prompt/confirm left in explorer code
- file rows draggable onto project rows (ref-based state so synthetic
  DataTransfer events work), drop target highlight, own project excluded,
  context-menu move kept as fallback

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
