From 56d5ce84f2572d20329c13a28c30afd3eecc1e69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Be <m.gonser@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 14:53:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat: integrate explorer into native open flow and main
 menu
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- optional onOpenSceneRequest prop on Excalidraw (fork-friendly 12-line hook
  in actionLoadScene) so menu Open, Ctrl/Cmd+O and the welcome screen show
  the explorer picker dialog instead of the native file picker
- picker dialog with project/file tree and 'Von Gerät öffnen…' fallback that
  flushes and detaches the active explorer file before applying a scene
  loaded from disk (prevents autosave from overwriting the explorer file)
- 'In Projekt speichern…' / 'Kopie speichern in…' main-menu entry saves the
  current scene as a new explorer file (existing or new project), makes it
  the active file and refreshes the panel

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
